# Angular wireframe

- Current supported Angular, **standalone** components, no NgModule app shell.
- Routes: `/portfolio`, `/projects/:id`, `/projects/:id/:domain` (`schedule|cost|safety|change`), plus issue/driver detail.
- Client-side state only (signals are preferred). `needsSteer` and review flags are in-memory.
- Accessibility baseline: semantic headings, labeled filters, visible `:focus-visible`, keyboard-reachable primary actions.
- `ng build` must succeed. `npm start` / `ng serve` is the preview path for Cloud Agents.
- Keep fixtures aligned with `docs/inputs/05-mock-data-contracts.md`.
